    "header": "猩红珍藏",
    "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"e4b71b2cd9eb20dc9a8a95581942d915\" title=\"林地城堡管家的笔记残片.png\" alt=\"林地城堡管家的笔记残片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/e4b71b2cd9eb20dc9a8a95581942d915.png\"/></div><p></p><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        维多利亚人来接收的时候觉得这里只是座破败城堡。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        空荡荡的，什么都没有。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        他们不知道子爵阁下为城堡花费了多少心力。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        也不清楚我们高卢人的忠诚与意志。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        这里有数不清的暗道、密室、阁楼，里面都堆满了宝藏。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        只——</span></span></em></span></h5><p></p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"5c2675b8046798634af8d727aa5a42f9\" title=\"猩红珍藏.png\" alt=\"猩红珍藏.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/5c2675b8046798634af8d727aa5a42f9.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"a538805eb81768f8740ee08d6557e4b4\" title=\"猩红珍藏2.png\" alt=\"猩红珍藏2.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220628/a538805eb81768f8740ee08d6557e4b4.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" id=\"e8edc6f52000c51beb35b14de8d35b9d\" alt=\"cg.png\" title=\"cg.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/e8edc6f52000c51beb35b14de8d35b9d.png\" width=\"201px\" height=\"80px\" style=\"width:201px;height:80px\"/></div><p style=\"text-align:left;\"></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【过往演出展览】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中回忆您在探索中经历的精彩瞬间。</span></span><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><br/></span></span></li></ul><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"1a968d49e0801f00c4039dc777488e39\" alt=\"月阵容.png\" title=\"月阵容.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/1a968d49e0801f00c4039dc777488e39.png\" width=\"201px\" height=\"80px\" style=\"width:201px;height:80px\"/></div><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【通讯记录仪】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看所有已收录的通讯记录。</span></span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" id=\"ed9339f27d3d6957272579beed739412\" alt=\"留声机吧.png\" title=\"留声机吧.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/ed9339f27d3d6957272579beed739412.png\" width=\"201px\" height=\"80px\" style=\"width:201px;height:80px\"/></div><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【留声典藏】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所解锁的所有主题特有曲目，并可选择心仪的曲目设为主题主界面曲目。</span></span></li></ul><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" id=\"e525db873ed11f87bf705ff44675e73a\" alt=\"道具.png\" title=\"道具.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/e525db873ed11f87bf705ff44675e73a.png\" width=\"201px\" height=\"80px\" style=\"width:201px;height:80px\"/></div><p style=\"text-align:left;\"></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【战术道具箱】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所获得的所有战术道具。</span></span><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><br/></span></span></li></ul><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"eea61933aaebf6d8c48d7a44ea1e988a\" alt=\"遗物.png\" title=\"遗物.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/eea61933aaebf6d8c48d7a44ea1e988a.png\" width=\"201px\" height=\"80px\" style=\"width:201px;height:80px\"/></div><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【长生者宝盒】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所获得的所有收藏品。</span></span></li></ul><p src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/xmLDi9jAK3AfnBMT63IX3O6oymSBqavWvLBp9d9h2BbvYgNE5VGqJBxIiJIok4vzJKgWd6wrbOMWk3961n9K37D_Lcw5_SNHEAd4E8Ba-maRhfPtU_hAfQeeBxyY_UIcndK01BDO\" width=\"135\" height=\"72\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" id=\"5c61eceb1033d4352918de2ea7bd0b96\" alt=\"剧目.png\" title=\"剧目.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/5c61eceb1033d4352918de2ea7bd0b96.png\" width=\"201px\" height=\"80px\" style=\"width:201px;height:80px\"/></div><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【活页剧目集】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看您所获得的所有剧目。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><h6 style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*图片仅供参考</span></span></h6>",
